#: 040cc2cb1e544b46b64a18e102517d1e
msgid "The UARTs are marked RXn and TXn in the above pinouts. The RXn pin is the receive pin for UARTn. The TXn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:40
#: be6ff9a0918d49558bff598243689f3e
msgid "The board also has SH6P 1mm connector for digital FPV systems which has UART6."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-jhemcuf405pro.rst:42
#: 60dcb896f38642ac8405ae8676227ff8
msgid "Please note that the board will not enter DFU mode if the receiver is connected to either USART1/USART3/USART4). If you have it soldered there due to DMA requirements you will need to temporarily desolder the wire on the FC's RX pad and solder it back after flashing."
msgstr ""

